<title>POLAND: KPBP Bick signs two German contracts.</title>
<headline>KPBP Bick signs two German contracts.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction company KPBP Bick signed two contracts with German firm Schock Bauunternehmen GmbH worth total of 1.54 million marks, the firm said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>It said the contracts concerned construction works in Germany. No further details were given.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
